WEBVTT

00:34:27.795 --> 00:34:31.336
but also more depth in the usage per user.

00:34:31.360 --> 00:34:34.074
Each user is using the internet more,

00:34:34.098 --> 00:34:35.987
contributing more data --

00:34:36.011 --> 00:34:38.233
mobile payment is an example,

00:34:38.257 --> 00:34:40.798
delivery of food, shared bicycles --

00:34:40.822 --> 00:34:42.514
there are many, many more examples.

00:34:42.538 --> 00:34:43.729
So you've got more users,

00:34:43.753 --> 00:34:46.029
and each user contributing more data,

00:34:46.053 --> 00:34:48.244
as well as an environment

00:34:48.268 --> 00:34:51.894
where more people are willing
to give up a little more data

00:34:51.918 --> 00:34:55.036
for convenience, security or advancement.

00:34:55.592 --> 00:34:57.736
On the government's support,

00:34:57.760 --> 00:35:01.724
China recognized the importance of AI
about two years ago,